summary:
$231 million investment to expand electrification includes new EV Charging Delivery Rate option to incentivize charging buildout;
Expanded EV training for municipalities adds 15 new communities

CHICAGO, August 09, 2023--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ComEd today joined with regional and municipal leaders to unveil its latest programs designed to accelerate the adoption of electrified technologies, including electric vehicles (EVs), in northern Illinois. As part of ComEd’s $231 million investment in new cust
